{
  "abstract": "Let f(n) be the least N such that any N points in the plane, no three on a line, contain a convex n-gon. Erdős and Szekeres proved 2^(n-2) + 1 ≤ f(n) ≤ C(2n-4, n-2) + 1 for n ≥ 3. This formalizes both bounds as stated in formal-conjectures (Erdős Problem 107, ersz_bounds). The upper bound comes from Linmiao Xu's formalization; the lower bound construction for all n is new.",
